      "direction": "soft_pebble",
      "name": "Pebble Shield",
      "form_language": "Soft pebble silhouette with continuous curved surfaces and generous corner radii, blending a smooth matte rABS body with a subtle raised bezel around the display for a premium soft-touch feel; ultra-slim profile achieved through efficient internal packaging and a sealed rear cover with hidden gasket.",
      "silhouette": "pebble",
