        "y_pct": 82.0
      },
      "usb": {
        "face": "right",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 50.0
      },
      "cmf": {
        "material": "rABS",
        "finish": "smooth_matte",
        "color": "deep ocean blue",
        "secondary_ops": [
          "soft_touch",
          "pad_print"
        ]
      },
      "intent_anchors": [
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA1",
          "statement": "Pebble silhouette with continuous curvature and 12 mm corner radius must be preserved for premium soft-touch aesthetic and drop resilience.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA2",
          "statement": "Front intake grille positioned at 82% height with a minimum 15% open area, protected by an internal ePTFE membrane vent to maintain IP67 while allowing airflow.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA3",
          "statement": "Display window (48x22 mm) centered at 40% height with a raised bezel to protect the screen and provide a soft-touch transition.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA4",
          "statement": "USB-C port on the right face, centered, with a captive silicone gasket plug to achieve IP67 without compromising slimness.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA5",
          "statement": "Soft-touch paint (polyurethane) over 100% recycled ABS (rABS) with smooth matte finish, applied only on the exterior, to meet premium feel and sustainability goals.",
          "category": "cmf",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA6",
          "statement": "Ultrasonic welding of the front and rear housing halves with a continuous perimeter gasket (TPE overmold) to seal against water and dust, maintaining IP67.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "This concept adapts the DFM-safe reference design by embracing a pebble silhouette to achieve a premium soft-touch feel while maintaining a slim 26 mm profile. The envelope is within the relaxed constraints (122x72x26 mm) and the mass target of 180 g is achievable with 1.5-2 mm wall thicknesses in rABS. The front intake at the bottom allows for effective airflow while an internal ePTFE membrane ensures IP67 without large openings. The USB port with a gasket plug maintains sealing. The use of 100% recycled ABS with soft-touch paint addresses sustainability and aesthetics. Cost is managed by using rABS and a simple two-shot molding process with pad printing for branding, aligning with the CNY 18 ceiling. The six-week timeline is aggressive but feasible with parallel tooling and testing if the design is frozen early; the pebble form reduces sharp corners that could complicate molding. Intent anchors capture the critical design decisions that must be preserved in downstream engineering to ensure the premium, durable, and sustainable aspects are not lost."
    },
